<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17010" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτέμβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, only pres.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maltreat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ καλὸν ἀτέμβειν . . ξείνους
					Τηλεμάχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.294
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				21.312
			</span></i>; <i>afflict, perplex,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτέμβει θυμὸν ἐνὶ στήθεσσιν Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.90
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, c. gen., <i>to be bereft</i> or <i>cheated of</i> a
			thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτέμβονται νεότητος</span> they
				<i>have lost their</i> youth, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.445
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτεμβόμενός γε σιδήρου</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				834
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τίς οἱ ἀτεμβόμενος κίοι ἴσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.705
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			
			like
			
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				5.147
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				173
			</span></i>: c. dat., <i>blame, be dissatisfied with,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.99
			</span></i>: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτεμβόμενος τοῖον στόλον ἀμφιπένεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.1199
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
